name: Committed path changes become bounded review hints with exact Git identities
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/changed_path_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/stage-alias-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 standalone stage | rejected-stage-expansion
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/changed_path_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART stage-alias
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/skipped-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Changed-path review skipped | no-baseline
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/changed_path_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART skipped
paste-file: @ART/invalid-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 resolve comparison commit | invalid-baseline
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/changed_path_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/review-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Changed-path review hints: 2 | committed-path-hints
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/changed_path_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART review
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | recorded-comparison
expect: Vulnerability findings: 0
expect: Actual merge base:
expect: Compared HEAD:
resize: 160x48
live-snap: comparison-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: comparison-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: comparison-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: comparison-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | comparison-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-01-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-02-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-03-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-04-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-05-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-06-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-07-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-08-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-09-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-10-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-11-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: comparison-reading-12-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | comparison-tail-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/changed_path_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART narrow
ask: Is this clearly a committed-path review hint, with explicit merge-base and HEAD identities, excluded working-tree changes and no vulnerability verdict, fix claim or Scan completion at all six sizes?
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Receipt | receipt-40x12
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/limited-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 partial path list | bounded-path-list
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/changed_path_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART limited
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/limited-replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | partial-result
expect: Outcome · partial
expect: Changed paths retained: 1/3; omitted: 2
expect: 2 changed file paths omitted
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | partial-result-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: partial-tail-40x12
ask: Does a zero-hint partial path list disclose omitted matching opportunities, keep every finding count at zero and offer no implicit scan or context acceptance?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
resize: 120x36
paste-file: @ART/limited-replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | restarted-partial
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | restarted-partial-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | restarted-tail-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/changed_path_review.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the exact historical comparison, partial-state warning and zero findings without a model, new job or source, HEAD or status changes?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
